          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.15.33+2KI.15.34+2KI.15.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kings 15.33-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Jotham was twenty-five years old when he began to reign, and he reigned sixteen years in Jerusalem. His mother's name was Jerushah the daughter of Zadok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he did what was right in the eyes of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " according to all that his father Uzziah had done—only he did not invade the temple of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". But the people still followed corrupt practices. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He built the upper gate of the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and did much building on the wall of Ophel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover he built cities in the hill country of Judah, and forts and towers on the wooded hills. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He fought with the king of the Ammonites and prevailed against them. And the Ammonites gave him that year a hundred talents of silver, and ten thousand cors of wheat and ten thousand of barley. The Ammonites paid him the same amount in the second and the third years. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Jotham became mighty, because he ordered his ways before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " his God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the rest of the acts of Jotham, and all his wars, and his ways, behold, they are written in the Book of the Kings of Israel and Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was twenty-five years old when he began to reign, and he reigned sixteen years in Jerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.15.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kings 15.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And Jotham slept with his fathers, and they buried him in the city of David; and Ahaz his son reigned in his stead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
